🎃 2025 Halloween Art Contest is On Now! 🎃

Draw your favorite Cat with the costumed look of your choice, and you might win a Cat Food prize!<br>
Entries accepted from October 27th until November 7th, 2025!

To enter:<br>
① Follow our Facebook account!<br>
② Download the template image from the comments!<br>
③ Draw a picture of your favorite Cat over the template!<br>
④ Enter by posting your creation as a comment on this post!

Your illustration might be featured in an in-game notice!<br>
💡 AI-generated images, entries from previous campaigns, and posts copied from other entrants or elsewhere on the internet will not be considered.<br>
💡 Entries that do not abide by the above rules or that are otherwise inappropriate may be removed from our page.

Post your creation to be entered into a random drawing for the below Cat Food prizes:<br>
・1 winner gets 1000 Cat Food!<br>
・3 winners get 600 Cat Food!<br>
・6 winners get 300 Cat Food!

💡 After the campaign, everyone will receive a Rare Ticket gift in thanks!<br>
The lucky winners will be announced on November 14th, 2025!<br>
Send in your best artistic creation, and you could win big!

